ee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/38px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png/25px-Melee_Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Melee_Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee: 1.5 m (5 ft)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 2.7 kg (5.4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 2.7 kg (5.4 lb)</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 960 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  960  gp</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_BG_Sarevok_OfChaos_Greatsword</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_BG_Sarevok_OfChaos_Greatsword\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_BG_Sarevok_OfChaos_Greatsword\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">e76b0896-dc70-4fb9-b202-cf5efc2de15a</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e76b0896-dc70-4fb9-b202-cf5efc2de15a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e76b0896-dc70-4fb9-b202-cf5efc2de15a\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_BG_Sarevok_OfChaos_Greatsword</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_BG_Sarevok_OfChaos_Greatsword+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_BG_Sarevok_OfChaos_Greatsword+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></dd></dl>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\"> Special </span></h3>\n<p><b>The holder of this item gains:</b>\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Chaos\" title=\"Chaos\">Chaos</a></dt><dd>On dealing damage with this weapon, regain <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/25px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/38px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/50px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/25px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">hit points</span></a>.<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\"><i>[<a href=\"/wiki/Chaos#Notes\" title=\"Chaos\">See Notes</a>]</i></sup></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Weapon_actions\"> Weapon actions </span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Proficiency Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/22px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <i>If you have <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a>, equip in <strong>main hand</strong> to gain:</i>\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pommel_Strike\" title=\"Pommel Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Pommel_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Pommel_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Pommel_Strike_Icon.webp/60px-Pommel_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1e/Pommel_Strike_Icon.webp/80px-Pommel_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pommel Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1e/Pommel_Strike_Icon.webp/40px-Pommel_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1e/Pommel_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pommel_Strike\" title=\"Pommel Strike\">Pommel Strike</a> (<span aria-label=\"Bonus Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bonus Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Make a non-lethal attack against an enemy and possibly <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dazed_(Condition)\" title=\"Dazed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Daze\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dazed_(Condition)\" title=\"Dazed (Condition)\">Daze</a> them. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lacerate\" title=\"Lacerate\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Lacerate_Icon.webp/40px-Lacerate_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Lacerate_Icon.webp/60px-Lacerate_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Lacerate_Icon.webp/80px-Lacerate_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lacerate\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Lacerate_Icon.webp/40px-Lacerate_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Lacerate_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lacerate\" title=\"Lacerate\">Lacerate</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Slash at your target's vital points to make it <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bleeding_(Condition)\" title=\"Bleeding (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bleed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bleeding_(Condition)\" title=\"Bleeding (Condition)\">Bleed</a>. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cleave\" title=\"Cleave\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Cleave_Icon.webp/40px-Cleave_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Cleave_Icon.webp/60px-Cleave_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a7/Cleave_Icon.webp/80px-Cleave_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cleave\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a7/Cleave_Icon.webp/40px-Cleave_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a7/Cleave_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cleave\" title=\"Cleave\">Cleave</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Swing your weapon in a large arc to attack up to 3 enemies at once. They each take half the damage your weapon usually deals. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rush_Attack\" title=\"Rush Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Rush_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Rush_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1a/Rush_Attack_Icon.webp/60px-Rush_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1a/Rush_Attack_Icon.webp/80px-Rush_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rush Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1a/Rush_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Rush_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1a/Rush_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rush_Attack\" title=\"Rush Attack\">Rush Attack</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Charge forward and attack the first enemy in your way, possibly pushing them <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Off_Balance_(Condition)\" title=\"Off Balance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Off Balance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Off_Balance_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Off_Balance_(Condition)\" title=\"Off Balance (Condition)\">Off Balance</a>. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>.)</dd>\n</dl></div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Murder_Tribunal\" title=\"Murder Tribunal\">Murder Tribunal</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1248&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;503</span>: Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok_Anchev\" title=\"Sarevok Anchev\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png/25px-Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png/38px-Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png/50px-Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sarevok Anchev\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png/25px-Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/df/Portrait_Sarevok_Anchev.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok_Anchev\" title=\"Sarevok Anchev\">Sarevok Anchev</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The Sword of Chaos is also found in <a href=\"/wiki/List_of_references_to_previous_Baldur%27s_Gate_games\" title=\"List of references to previous Baldur's Gate games\">Baldur's Gate 2</a>. The description of the item in Baldur's Gate 3 refers to the events of the storyline of the previous game.</li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Chaos:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Chaos does not trigger when damaging items.</li>\n<li>On-heal effects such as <a href=\"/wiki/Blessed_Mercy\" title=\"Blessed Mercy\">Blessed Mercy</a> do not trigger through Chaos either.</li>\n<li>The wielder is healed upon <i>each instance</i> of damage. This means that in the case of attacks which deal multiple damage types, such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Booming_Blade\" title=\"Booming Blade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/20px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/30px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/40px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Booming Blade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/20px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Booming_Blade\" title=\"Booming Blade\">Booming Blade</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Smite\" title=\"Divine Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/30px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Divine Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Divine_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Divine_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Smite\" title=\"Divine Smite\">Divine Smite</a> (as well as other <a href=\"/wiki/Smite\" title=\"Smite\">Smite</a> spells), or in the case of attacks which damage multiple targets, such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slashing_Flourish_(Melee)\" title=\"Slashing Flourish (Melee)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/30px-Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/37/Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/40px-Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slashing Flourish (Melee)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/37/Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/20px-Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/37/Slashing_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Slashing_Flourish_(Melee)\" title=\"Slashing Flourish (Melee)\">Slashing Flourish (Melee)</a>, the wielder is healed multiple times.</li>\n<li>The in-game description says \"On a hit, regain <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/25px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/38px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/50px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"hit points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/25px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">hit points</span></a>.\".</li></ul>\n</div>     \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 302px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 300px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Sword_of_Chaos_ingame.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Appearance in game\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Sword_of_Chaos_ingame.png/450px-Sword_of_Chaos_ingame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0f/Sword_of_Chaos_ingame.png/675px-Sword_of_Chaos_ingame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/0f/Sword_of_Chaos_ingame.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Appearance in game\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Sword_of_Chaos_ingame.png/450px-Sword_of_Chaos_ingame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0f/Sword_of_Chaos_ingame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Appearance in game</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 62px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 60px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Sword_of_Chaos_Concept_Art.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Concept Art\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Sword_of_Chaos_Concept_Art.png/89px-Sword_of_Chaos_Concept_Art.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Sword_of_Chaos_Concept_Art.png/134px-Sword_of_Chaos_Concept_Art.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Sword_of_Chaos_Concept_Art.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Concept Art\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Sword_of_Chaos_Concept_Art.png/89px-Sword_of_Chaos_Concept_Art.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\